  "privacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacySubtitle": "Your privacy matters to us",
  "privacyUpdated": "Last updated: November 2025",
  "privacyS1Title": "Data Controller",
  "privacyS1Body": "reDreamAI\nRepresented by: Daniel Menzel, Ramon Zacharias\nInstitute for Cognitive Science\nWachsbleiche 27\nD-49090 Osnabrück, Germany\nEmail: info@redreamai.com",
  "privacyS2Title": "Data Collection and Processing",
  "privacyS2Body": "We process the content you share with the chatbot (dream and nightmare descriptions, conversation history), technical data (IP address, device and browser information) and usage data (how you interact with the app).",
  "privacyS3Title": "Purpose of Data Processing",
  "privacyS3Body": "Your data is used to provide and improve the dream chatbot, to understand how the app is used, to keep the service secure, and to comply with legal obligations.",
  "privacyS4Title": "Legal Basis",
  "privacyS4Body": "Processing is based on your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR) and on our legitimate interests in operating and securing the service (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).",
  "privacyS5Title": "Data Storage and Retention",
  "privacyS5Body": "Your data is stored on servers located in the European Union and kept only as long as needed to provide the service or as required by law. You can delete your data or your account at any time from the settings.",
  "privacyS6Title": "Data Security",
  "privacyS6Body": "We use encryption in transit and at rest, access controls and regular reviews to protect your data against unauthorised access, loss or misuse.",
  "privacyS7Title": "Your Rights",
  "privacyS7Body": "You have the right to access (Art. 15), rectify (Art. 16), erase (Art. 17), restrict (Art. 18), port (Art. 20) and object to (Art. 21) the processing of your data, and to withdraw consent at any time (Art. 7(3)). Contact us at info@redreamai.com.",
  "privacyS8Title": "Cookies and Similar Technologies",
  "privacyS8Body": "The app stores settings and caches locally on your device to work offline. No advertising cookies or trackers are used.",
  "privacyS9Title": "Third-Party Services",
  "privacyS9Body": "We rely on European hosting and AI providers bound by data processing agreements. Dream content is only shared with the AI provider to generate responses.",
  "privacyS10Title": "Changes to This Policy",
  "privacyS10Body": "We may update this policy from time to time. The current version is always available in the app and on our website.",
